Shit!

2342
02:10:15.534 --> 02:10:17.030
Court!

2343
02:10:17.030 --> 02:10:19.098
[indistinct chatter]

2344
02:10:19.439 --> 02:10:21.199
[whooshing]

2345
02:10:21.969 --> 02:10:23.377
[grunts]

2346
02:10:25.676 --> 02:10:28.877
...original trial
was initially...

2347
02:10:31.517 --> 02:10:33.145
I’m so sorry.

2348
02:10:36.852 --> 02:10:39.217
As I was saying...

2349
02:10:39.217 --> 02:10:41.461
the same
security camera footage,

2350
02:10:41.461 --> 02:10:43.430
Exhibit F
in the original trial,

2351
02:10:43.430 --> 02:10:45.762
