2374
02:11:53.500 --> 02:11:54.732
Unquote.

2375
02:11:55.502 --> 02:11:58.769
I’m sorry, that makes
absolutely no sense. What are
you talking about, sir?

2376
02:11:58.769 --> 02:12:02.267
